          "_name": "news05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news05\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Upcoming events with images</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-5 active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n        <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2025-10-20-09.13.49-2.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg item-wrapper\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n          <b>对称构图</b>\n        </h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          July 12-13, 2025\n        </h6>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">两个人物分别位于左右两侧，姿态相似、位置平衡，形成了以画面中央为轴的视觉对称。</p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} \">\n        <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/why-are-the-walls-grey-v0-19qwgyq0a57f1.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg item-wrapper\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n          <b>顶视构图</b>\n        </h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          March 15, 2025\n        </h6>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">能清楚看到整座城市被高墙包围的形态与结构；让城市与周围的墙形成强烈对比，突显出“被围困”的感觉。</p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
